  "description": "The figure who has been recorded being present at many historical events… He seems to be human, a grey old man. Is it really possible that a simple human can manage to conquer time? This man often is depicted next to powerful figures in history, right by their side... Could he have been whispering in their ears? How could a simple human be present in such important events throughout history? Nothing is known about him, only rumors and legends. However… there is someone in present day who matches the figure's description. A man who used to advise a good king during his reign over a beautiful kingdom. After his king died, the old man decided to live in a small cottage in the kingdom´s capitol. It is rumored that he befriended a young squire, helping him with his knight training. Could he be the same man from the legends?",
  "summon": "Are there any strings on you?",
  "fusion": "Dance, little puppets…",
